With software RT, everyone gets the same technology limited only by raw compute, With hardware RT, Nvidia decides: How many RT cores you get, How efficient they are, How badly lower-tier cards are nerfed, RT core performance doesn’t scale linearly. A card with 3× the RT cores may only give you 2× the frame rate.

